  "description": "Rising further up the size scale is the Race Lite Junior. The Junior shares the same 20\" alloy wheel size as the Mini but the 6061 alloy frame, 3 piece alloy cranks and handlebars all increase in size to accommodate growing riders. Balanced geometry, function and control are all achieved through features like integrated chain adjusters, 100% chromoly fork, CNC alloy stem and sealed bearings throughout the wheels and bottom bracket.\n6061 series smooth weld alloy frame with integrated head tube, internal cable routing, 3D dropouts with integrated chain tensioners\n100% chromoly fork\nAlloy bars and Haro CNC alloy front load stem\n3-piece alloy race cranks with sealed Euro BB\nFully sealed wheels with double wall alloy rims, a sealed rear cassette hub and alloy nipples\nKenda Kontact tires\nPromax V-Brake and lever",
